{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49496","headline":"虞美人 一 · 顾敻","name":"虞美人 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"晓莺啼破相思梦，帘卷金泥凤。\n宿妆犹在酒初醒，翠翘慵整倚云屏，转娉婷。\n香檀细画侵桃脸，罗袂轻轻歛。\n佳期堪恨再难寻，绿芜满院柳成阴，负春心。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"顾敻","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_49496.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49496","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}